// The functions of this namespace whose names begin with `_` and that find or write the decimal
// digits of a floating point number, and the tables they read, are translated from Ryu by Ulf Adams
// (https://github.com/ulfjack/ryu), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, a copy of which
